    its flap folded down.

    Drawn as an outline rather than a solid block so it reads as an envelope at 22dp: filled, the flap's
    diagonals disappear into the body and the shape becomes an anonymous rectangle. See
    ic_profile_person.xml for why these badges are glyphs rather than the four-letter codes they replaced,
    and why none of them sets its own tint.
-->
